/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The Grand Ballroom of 1565 square metres is a magnificent venue, providing conference seating for up to 2400 delegates in theatre style, 1800 in conference style and 1200 in banqueting style. These indications are valid for a set-up excluding staging, translation booths or any space requirements for back projection. With the light tumbling down from crystal chandeliers, it provides a perfect venue for any occasion. This room can divide into eight different venues, each separated by American oak sliding doors. There is a huge Pre-Assembly area which can accommodate up to 1000 guests, as well as a private Presidential Entrance, which is used by the President and Prime Minister of Namibia and other dignitaries and VIP guests to the Centre.)
/E (The Grand Ballroom of 1565 square metres is a magnificent venue, providing conference seating for up to 2400 delegates in theatre style, 1800 in conference style and 1200 in banqueting style. These indications are valid for a set-up excluding staging, translation booths or any space requirements for back projection. With the light tumbling down from crystal chandeliers, it provides a perfect venue for any occasion. This room can divide into eight different venues, each separated by American oak sliding doors. There is a huge Pre-Assembly area which can accommodate up to 1000 guests, as well as a private Presidential Entrance, which is used by the President and Prime Minister of Namibia and other dignitaries and VIP guests to the Centre.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
