/T (The Namib rooms are situated at the end of the courtyard, opposite the Nomad Restaurant in Mercure Hotel Windhoek. This beautiful venue can be divided into two of which the Namib 2 Hall opens up onto a Patio towards the Pool and Garden. Two Flamingo Rooms have the size of Boardrooms and can accommodate small meetings. Next to the swimming pool leading off from the Mercure Hotel Windhoek Reception, is the Nossob Room with its Pre-Assembly area. This venue is able to accommodate 160 to 300 delegates.)
/E (The Namib rooms are situated at the end of the courtyard, opposite the Nomad Restaurant in Mercure Hotel Windhoek. This beautiful venue can be divided into two of which the Namib 2 Hall opens up onto a Patio towards the Pool and Garden. Two Flamingo Rooms have the size of Boardrooms and can accommodate small meetings. Next to the swimming pool leading off from the Mercure Hotel Windhoek Reception, is the Nossob Room with its Pre-Assembly area. This venue is able to accommodate 160 to 300 delegates.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
